# Service-account credentials — NEVER commit these.
# The Firebase Admin key (FCM push sender) lives only in Render's
# FCM_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_B64. Any local copy of the JSON is a private key and must
# stay out of the repo. Note this does NOT cover portal-production/android/app/
# google-services.json, which is deliberately committed: that one is client
# config shipped inside every APK, not a credential.
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
*-service-account*.json
*service-account-key*.json
serviceAccountKey*.json
gcp-credentials*.json
